<title>POLAND: BIG trades on kerb at PLN 3.9.</title>
<headline>BIG trades on kerb at PLN 3.9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 3,293,925 shares of Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych (BIG) at 3.9 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session BIG closed at 4.15 zlotys in a 668,886 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
